  "description": "LiteOrm.DependencyInjection DI 扩展：LiteOrm 的依赖注入与 AOP 集成层。基于 Autofac 与 Castle DynamicProxy，通过 RegisterLiteOrm() 一键注册，支持声明式事务、权限、日志拦截与自动建表。",
  "id": "LiteOrm.DependencyInjection",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-06T08:11:59.763Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "Ij9rdNO5eguaw1RjvBUlXquafJXITH3bQ/cKHbCKyOzOcEnHCmdK7NHJiLnIYQZEHegWDu1Nmo657NT3sNGVSA==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 118375,
  "projectUrl": "https://danjiewu.github.io/LiteOrm",
  "published": "2026-08-06T08:08:51.733Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.DependencyInjection.nuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "8.1.0 (New Package):\n- 新增 LiteOrm.DependencyInjection 包，RegisterLiteOrm() 由 LiteOrm 基础包移至本包（命名空间 LiteOrm.DependencyInjection）。\n\nBreaking Changes:\n- 核心实体服务与数据访问对象由 [AutoRegister] 扫描改为 RegisterCoreServices() 显式注册；\n- 数据源配置由 DataSourceProviderExtensions 从宿主 IConfiguration 的 LiteOrm 节点加载。\n\nNew Features:\n- 基于 Autofac 与 Castle DynamicProxy 的 AOP 拦截（事务 / 权限 / 日志）；\n- 自动应用 [AutoRegister] 源生成注册；\n- 宿主集成 / Remote 使用单例 ProxyGenerator 优化性能。",
